      "id": 12,
      "title": "Where you train",
      "description": "Density of GPS points of the activities in the dashboard time range. Rare outliers (outside the 2nd–98th percentile) are left out, so the map fits where you usually train.",
      "type": "geomap",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
